※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4576

※ A record is its fields and nothing else, and which fields it has is what its
※ definition says.  A name that is not one of them names nothing: there is no
※ value to read and nothing to give, whichever end asked.

type Point = x : u32 ; y : u32

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let p : Point = Point(.x ← 1u32, .z ← 2u32)
    if p.x = 1u32: 0u6 else: 1u6
